      "content": "but thats just what people say to be nice. the reality is that the version of me that actually lived, that felt alive, is just... gone. it's not a \"part of my story\", it's the end of the book. i look in the mirror and i'm just looking at a stranger who can't even walk the way they used to. it feels way more like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life.",
